Major announcement part 2!

688
01:10:38,312 --> 01:10:44,912
悠月ちょこ3周年の記念グッズが発売されます！
Yuzuki Choco's 3rd Anniversary goods are now on sale!

689
01:10:46,912 --> 01:10:52,612
いや、今回はやばいんですよ、皆様。色々と。
Man, this time is crazy, guys. In so many ways.

690
01:10:53,012 --> 01:10:56,912
